                                        <body>
                                        <center>
                                        <table width='600' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='20'>
                                          <tr>
                                            <td><h3>Version: TDSMAN 14.91</h3>
                                              <h3>Version Date: 30th January, 2014</h3>
                                              <h3>Released on: 30th January, 2014</h3>
                                              <h2>Current  Version updates</h2>
                                              <h2>The following problems in the  software are now fixed:</h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Software closing problem in Windows 8</li>
                                                <li>Download problem in TRACES module</li>
                                                <li>Return submission problem with file names having  special characters.</li>
                                                <li>Data entry problem in correction return.</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>Previous  Version updates (14.90)</h2>
                                              <h2>Salary Tax Calculator &ndash; Form 24Q</h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>An automatic Tax calculator has been added in  Salary details module. This will show the Income Tax, Surcharge and Cess as per  the Taxable Income provided.</li>
                                                <li>User will also have the facility to view the  details of the tax calculation.</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>View all tax deductions in Salary  Details &ndash; Form 24Q</h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>While entering the Salary Details in the 4th  Quarter, users can now view the taxes that have been deducted from an employee  in all the quarters of that financial year. (Provided all quarters data is present  in the software)</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>New fields added in Salary  Details (as per the new FVU rules)</h2>
                                              <p>The following new fields have  been added in the &lsquo;Salary Details&rsquo; module:</p>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Taxable amount on which tax is deducted by  current employer.</li>
                                                <li>Reported taxable amount on which tax is deducted  by previous employer.</li>
                                                <li>Amount of Tax deducted by current employer (sum  of tax deducted in all four quarters of that financial year).</li>
                                                <li>Reported tax deducted by previous employer.</li>
                                                <li>Higher rate mark (to be marked for employees not  having valid PAN).</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>User preferences module added &ndash;  under Utilities menu</h2>
                                              <p>User preferences module is now  added in the software which allows the following user customizations in the  software:</p>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Facility to add password</li>
                                                <li>Option to show deducted date while entering  deductee details.</li>
                                                <li>Option to copy the values present in &lsquo;Interest&rsquo;  field and &lsquo;Others&rsquo; field to &lsquo;Interest Allocated&rsquo; and &lsquo;Others Allocated&rsquo; fields.</li>
                                                <li>Option to save the last return used for  automatic selection of Financial Year, Form &amp; Company when a form is  selected.</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>Provision to enter Proxy settings  &ndash; under Preferences</h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Users who have to enter proxy settings to access  internet can now use all the web related features in the software.</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>Return Reports updated</h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Return reports have been modified to accommodate  the new fields added by the department.</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>Additional date format dd-MM-yyyy  now allowed</h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Software now allows additional date format  dd-MM-yyyy</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>Extract the Zip files downloaded  from TRACES</h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Software now provides the facility to extract  the zip files downloaded from the department&rsquo;s website by internally providing  the password.</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>Other Misc. updates</h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>TRACES modules updated to incorporate new  changes in the TRACES website.</li>
                                                <li>Link added in Utility menu to download useful  TDS related forms.</li>
                                                <li>Extra warnings added in Challan Details &amp; Deductee  Details module to minimize defaults due to data entry.</li>
                                                <li>Bug fixes in excel import. </li>
                                                <li>Improvement in Salary detail scrolling.</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <p>&nbsp;</p>
                                              <p>&nbsp;</p>      <h3>&nbsp;</h3>
                                              </td>
                                          </tr>
                                        </table>
                                        </center>
                                        </body>
                                        </html>";
                            #endregion
                            strSQL = @"INSERT INTO MST_NEW_UPDATE (VERSION_NO, UPDT_DATE, RELEASE_DATE, UPDATE_TEXT_HTML) VALUES (14.91, '30-Jan-2014', '30-Jan-2014', '" + cmnService.J_ReplaceQuote(strValue) + "')";
                            dmlService.J_ExecSql(strSQL);
                        }
                        #endregion
