                    </style></head>
                    <body>
                    <center>
                    <table width='600' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='20'>
                      <tr>
                        <td><h3>Version: TDSMAN 15.01</h3>
                          <h3>Version Date: 27th March, 2014</h3>
                          <h3>Released on: 27th March, 2014</h3>
                          <h2>Current  Version updates</h2>
                          <h2>The following problems in the  software are now fixed:</h2>
                          <ul>
                            <li>Download and extraction of files from TRACES</li>
                            <li>Interest calculation in Defaults prediction</li>
                            <li>Tax Calculation for Senior citizens in Salary  details &amp; other minor bugs.</li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>Additional Features</strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>In Employee master module reference code is now  displayed in the front grid.</li>
                          </ul>
                          <h2>Previous  Version updates (15.0) &ndash; Released with FY &ndash; 2014-15</h2>
                          <p><strong>Bulk TAN-PAN file download from TRACES</strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>Download bulk TAN-PAN file of any previous  return from TRACES from the software interface itself</li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>Prediction of Defaults</strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>Know all the short deductions, late payments  made in the return before its actual filing, using the default predictor.</li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>Auto Tax Calculation in non salary forms</strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>Auto tax calculation option has now been added  to all non &ndash; salary forms.</li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>Calculate monthly TDS on Salary</strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>Calculate monthly TDS to be deducted from  employee&rsquo;s salary using this module. </li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>Option to add records to the existing  return using Excel</strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>During excel import, TDSMAN provides the  additional option of adding the records to the existing data. It becomes  helpful when excel import is done in batches.</li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>Employee Reference No. </strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>User now has the facility of adding Employee  reference number against each employee. This number will also be sent in TDS  return and subsequently will get reflected in the TRACES Form 16 certificate</li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>Import Employee Master through excel</strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>Import the employee records through excel for  creating the Excel master.</li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>Print TDS Certificate from Correction  Returns</strong></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li>Print the latest TDS Certificate after making  the required corrections through this option.</li>
                          </ul>
                          <p><strong>PAN Verification option in all Deductee modules</strong></p>
                          PAN verification option has now been provided in  all modules where PAN is entered.</td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                    </center>
                    </body>
                    </html>";
                            #endregion
