                                        <center>
                                        <table width='600' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='20'>
                                          <tr>
                                            <td><h3>Version: TDSMAN 15.24</h3>
                                              <h3>Version Date: 24th June 2014</h3>
                                              <h3>Released on: 24th June 2014</h3>
                                              <h2>Extract Names of all the PANs  used in the return</h2>
                                              <p>Option provided in the TRACES information menu to extract  names of all the PANs used in the return.</p>
                                              <h2>Validate 197 certificate online</h2>
                                              <p>Option provided in the TRACES information menu to validate  &ldquo;197 certificate&rdquo; provided for lower / no deduction of taxes.</p>
                                              <h2>PDS Converter for 27D certificate</h2>
                                              <p>Option provided in the TRACES information menu to download  PDF converter, which is used to convert 27D certificate downloaded from TRACES  website to .pdf format.</p>
                                              <h2>Return report provided in  corrections</h2>
                                              <p>Return report option has now been provided for correction  returns for viewing the updated report as per the corrections done.</p>
                                              <h2>Check BIN details online</h2>
                                              <p>Option provided in the NSDL information menu to check BIN  details (payments made through book entry) online.</p>
                                              <h2>Fine tunings </h2>
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Display of totals in predict defaults</li>
                                                <li>Restructuring of Salary details interface &amp;  report (Showing breakup of current and previous employer values alongside its  actual amount)</li>
                                                <li>Form 16 is now updated as per the new format  provided by income tax department.</li>
                                                <li>Restriction of records with zero tax having no  valid remarks.</li>
                                                <li>Option provided to show only company filtered  deductees in the help screen.</li>
                                                <li>Loading speed of correction reports made faster</li>
                                                <li>PAN verification now includes PAN from Salary  details records</li>
                                              </ul>
                                              <h2>Other Bug Fixes</h2>
                                              
                                              <ul>
                                                <li>Calculation problem in Default Prediction</li>
                                                <li>Deductee listing report improved. </li>
                                              </ul>      
                                              </td>
                                          </tr>
                                        </table>
                                        </center>
                                        </body>
                                        </html>
                                        ";
