                                    <body>
                                        <table style='margin:auto; border:solid 1px black;' width='800' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='20'>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>
                                                    <h3>
                                                        Version: TDSMAN <u>16.16</u></h3>
                                                    <h3>
                                                        Version Date: <strong><u>25th June</u></strong><u> 2015</u></h3>
                                                    <h3>
                                                        Released on: <strong><u>25th June </u></strong><u>2015</u></h3>
                                                    <h2>
                                                        Incorporation of new sections 192A and 194LBB:</h2>
                                                    <p>
                                                        Section 192 has been added to Form No. 26Q and will be applicable from statements
                                                        pertaining to Q1 of Financial Year 2015-16.<br />
                                                        Section 194LBB has been added to Form No. 26Q and Form No. 27Q and will be applicable
                                                        from statements pertaining to Q1 of Financial Year 2015-16.
                                                    </p>
                                                    <h2>
                                                        Total tax and Tax deposited should now be equal:</h2>
                                                    <p>
                                                        Previously, value in Tax Deposited field was permitted to be different from Total
                                                        tax. Now according to the new rules specified in the release notes of FVU 4.7, both
                                                        these fields have to be equal.</p>
                                                    <h2>
                                                        Quoting of 197 Certificate no. allowed in particular sections:</h2>
                                                    <p>
                                                        Quoting of 197 certificate number is now allowed in sections - 192, 193, 194, 194A,
                                                        194C, 194D, 194G, 194H, 194-I, 194J, 194LA, 195 and 206C.</p>
                                                    <h2>
                                                        Correction of 'Higher Rate' marked records:</h2>
                                                    <p>
                                                        All fields except 'Total tax' and 'Higher rate' reason value can now be modified
                                                        for records marked with 'C' flag.</p>
                                                    <h2>
                                                        Print Challan 281</h2>
                                                    <p>
                                                        One can now print Challan 281 by visiting the utilities menu of the software.</p>
                                                    <h2>
                                                        Set Backup reminder from the Preference module</h2>
                                                    <p>
                                                        Users can now set reminder frequency for Backup as per their requirement. An alert
                                                        will be flashed at the time of starting the software.</p>
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>
                                    </body>
                                    </html>";
                            #endregion
                            //
                            strSQL = @"INSERT INTO MST_NEW_UPDATE (VERSION_NO, UPDT_DATE, RELEASE_DATE,  UPDATE_TEXT_HTML) VALUES (16.16, '25-Jun-2015', '25-Jun-2015', '" + cmnService.J_ReplaceQuote(strValue) + "')";
