                                                        </h2>
                                                        <h2>
                                                            Changes for Remark 'B'- Non deduction of TDS under section 197A
                                                        </h2>
                                                        <ul>
                                                            <li>Remark 'B' is made applicable for section code 194DA (Payment in respect of life insurance policy) </li>
