                                                        </p>
                                                        <h2 style='font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px'>
                                                            Other Changes
                                                        </h2>
                                                        <h2>
                                                            Default path of file generation shifted to Documents folder
                                                        </h2>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Default path of file generation has been shifted to documents folder. This has been done to avoid errors in newer operating systems that do not allow any file creation in installation folder.
