				                                            <p>Proposed financial rates for financial year 2016-17 has now been provided in the software for both salary and non salary forms.</p>
                                                            
                                                            <h2>
                                                                Rounding off option of Taxable Income 
                                                            </h2>
				                                            <p>Users can now round off the taxable income to the nearest 10. 
				                                            For example taxable income '3,00,154.00' can be rounded off to '3,00,150.00'
				                                            &amp; income '3,00,156.00' can be rounded off to '3,00,160.00'.</p>
				                                            <p>This option can be enabled from preferences menu.</p>
                                                            <h2>
                                                                Quoting of company's branch mandatory
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <p>
                                                                Quoting of company's branch is mandatory for preparation of TDS returns. 
					                                            In case the branch value is not provided File validation utility will generate an error.
                                                            </p>
                                                            <p>
                                                                To handle this TDSMAN is providing default 'NA' value in the branch while generating TDS returns in case no value is provided.  
					                                            You can update the branch by updating the company details from company master.
                                                            </p>
                                                            <h2>
                                                                Excel template creation module simplified
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <p>
                                                                Excel creation module has now been simplified. Now you can just select the relevant financial year 
					                                            and the software will decide what structure will be applicable to the selected financial year.
                                                            </p>
                                                            <hr />
                                                        </td>
                                                    </tr>
                                                </table>
                                            </body>
                                            </html>";
                            #endregion
