							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>
							Change in Validation in 'PAN for Lender' in Salary Details in Form 24Q-Q4 from FY:16-17 onwards</h2>
								 <p>Existing validation of structurally valid PAN for one or multiple 
                                    lenders have been relaxed. These fields may contain values as mentioned below in addition to structurally valid PAN, only when PAN of 
                                    lender is not available:
							<li> GOVERNMENT: This is applicable when lenders are Government
								organizations (i.e. Central or State).</li>
							<li> NONRESDENT: This is applicable when the lenders are Non-Residents.</li>
							<li> OTHERVALUE: This is applicable when the lenders are other than
							Government organization and Non-Residents.</li>

							</p>    
	                                                </br>
							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>Addition of new Section Code in Form 26Q - applicable from FY:2017-18 onwards                                                 </h2>
							<p>'194IC - Payment under specified agreement' had been added in Form 26Q. It will apply to Regular and C3 type Correction Statement wherein update / delete / addition of deductee details is allowed. <p/>
							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>Change in validation for Section Code 194D (Form 26Q) - applicable from FY:17-18 onwards 
                                                        </h2><p>Section 194D pertains to 'Insurance and Commission' - following changed 
