                            FY:17-18 onwards
                                                                                    </h2>
							                            <p>Section 206CC pertains to 'Collection at Source from Timber obtained by any 
                            mode other than a forest lease' - following changes are made in the validation:
                            <li>Remark 'C' (higher rate deduction) made applicable exclusively for this section</li>
                            <li>'C' remark is only allowed when values 'PANAPPLIED', 'PANINVALID' OR 'PANNOTAVBL' are present in the field 'PAN of Deductee'</li>
