							                            <h2 style='font-weight:bold'>
                                                            Current version summary is as under:
                                                        </h2>
				                        <br /><br />
							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>
							Predict Defaults : </h2>
								 <p>Late Fine calculation facility has been added to Predict Defaults.</p>    
	                                                </br>
							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>
                                                            AADHAR link provided to file return online :</h2>
								<p>While generating return through regular/correction module, on successful FVU creation a link has been provided to file return using AADHAR.</p>    
	                                                </br>
							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>
                                                            Import Company master :</h2>
								<p>While creating a new company, you can now import the data from conso file.</p>    
	                                                </br>
							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>
                                                            Excel Import :</h2>
								<p>Now deducted date can be entered through excel import also.</p>    
	                                                </br>

							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>
                                                            Company listing detail report :</h2>
								<p>Now Company listing report in details format.</p>    
	                                                </br>

							<h2 style='font-weight:bold'>
                                                            Form 16 & Form 16A : </h2>
								<p>Now search option is available with PAN along Name.</p>    
	                                                </br>

