							                            <h2 style='font-weight:bold'>FVU 6.9 & 2.165 launched by NSDL</h2></h2>	<br /> 			                                                                                      
							                    <li>Addition of new sections 194LBA(a) and 194LBA(b) for Form 26Q - applicable from FY
													2020-21 onwards. New remark 'O' will be added to the Remarks field for both sections with description 'O - No deduction is as per the provisions of sub-section(2A) of section 194LBA'.</li>
                                                   <br/>
                                                <li>Addition of new sections 194NF for Form 26Q and 27Q - applicable from FY 2020-21 & Qtr 2 onwards. Remark 'M' will be added to the field 'Remarks' with description 'M - No deduction or lower deduction is on account of notification issued under second proviso to section 194N'.</li>  
                                                      <br/>  
                                                  <li>Addition of new sections 194LBA(a), 194LBA(b) and 194LBA(c) for Form 27Q - applicable from FY 2020 - 21 onwards.New remark 'O' will be added to the Remarks field for these sections with description 'O - No deduction is as per the provisions of sub-section (2A) of section 194LBA'.</li>      
                                                          <br/><li>Addition of new D - 'No deduction or lower deduction is on account of payment made to a person or class of person on account of notification issued under sub - section(5) of section of 194A' for section code 194A of Form 26Q applicable for regular and correction statements pertaining to FY 2020 - 21 onwards.</li>
      
                                                          <br/>
      
                                                      <li>Addition of new E - 'No deduction is on account of payment being made to a person referred to in Board Circular no. 3 of 2002 dated 28th June, 2002 or
      
                                                          Board Circular no. 11 of 2002 dated 22nd November, 2002 or Board Circular no. 18 of 2017 dated 28th May, 2017' for all sections of Form 26Q applicable for regular and correction statements pertaining to
      
                                                          FY 2020 - 21 onwards. </li>
      
                                                          <br/>
      
                                                      <li> Addition of new G - 'No deduction is in view of clause (a) or clause (b) of sub-section
                                                          (1D) of section 197A' for all sections of Form 27Q applicable for regular and correction statements pertaining to      
                                                          FY 2020 - 21 onwards. </li>      
                                                          </br>      
                                                      <li> Addition of new columns for Form 26Q and 27Q for Section 194NF pertaining to FY 2020 - 21 for quarter 2 onwards - 'Amount of cash withdrawal which is in excess of 20 lakhs but
           
