							                            <h2 style='font-weight:bold'>Compliance Check for Section 206AB && 206CCA</h2></h2>	<br/> 			                                                                                      
														<li>Via Finance Act 2021, Section 206AB and 206CCA are inserted in the Income-tax Act,1961 (effective from 1st July 2021). Higher rate as twice the prescribed rate 
														or 5% which is higher is applicable (other than under sections 192, 192A, 194B, 194BB, 194LBC and 194N) for 'Specified Persons'. 
