														<h2><b>Form 16 - Tax Computation (Bulk)</b></h2>
														<p>While entering Salary Details in Annexure II (Form 24Q), there is an option to cross-check the tax amount as entered with the system generated computed tax. However, this could only be viewed one at a time for each employee. On popular demand, now a new module has been added, wherein in a single click, the entered tax amount and the computed tax can be viewed for all. If required, there is an option to download the same in an excel sheet. This can be accessed from <b>Regular Return</b> menu</b>
							                            <h2><b>OTP based download of CSI file</b></h2>
														<p>The CSI file is required to validate the Challans through the File Validation Utility (FVU). Till recently, the Income Tax Department was allowing download of this file only after login to the portal www.incometax.gov.in. Many tax payers were struggling as this required TAN registration on the portal. However, to ease matters, as an alternative, now the portal is allowing download of the file through OTP authentication using any mobile number.</b>.<br/> 							
														<p>TDSMAN has been updated to allow both the alternatives of downloading the CSI file, i.e. through login with 'password' to the Income Tax portal or through OTP from the same portal (without login).</b><br/> 							
														<p>At the time of 'Create FVU', if 'password' is available, it will automatically apply the 'password' and complete the file generation process seamlessly. However, if 'password' is missing, it will ask for 'Mobile No.' which needs to be provided. The OTP should come to the entered Mobile which needs to be entered. Once successfully done, it will proceed with the file generation process.</b>.<br/> 							
														<p>In case, any user wants to opt for 'password' based authentication, go to the 'Company Master' and check on 'Download CSI through Password'. Once this is done, next time, the 'password' will asked (instead of Mobile No.) on clicking 'Create FVU'.</b><br/>			
							                            <h2><b>Challan Download</b></h2>  															
							                            <p>Challan can be downloaded from TRACES while entering the challan. Only amount needs to be validated.<br/>  
														<br>Reported bugs rectified.<br/>
							                                         </br>
                                                                 </br><a href = 'https://blog.tdsman.com/' > Click here </a> to view TDSMAN blog.
                                                                      </td>
                                                                      </tr>
                                                                  </table>
                                                              </body>
                                                              </html>";
                    #endregion
                    //
                    strSQL = @"INSERT INTO MST_NEW_UPDATE (VERSION_NO, UPDT_DATE, RELEASE_DATE, UPDATE_TEXT_HTML) VALUES (24.17, '22-May-2023', '22-May-2023', '" + cmnService.J_ReplaceQuote(strValue) + "')";
                    dmlService.J_ExecSql(strSQL);
                    //--                    
                }
