                                                        <h2><b>Inoperative PAN</b></h2>
														<p>Recently, the IT Department has introduced 'Inoperative PAN' owing to non-linking of the Aadhaar. 
															For such PANs, TDS has to be deducted at maximum rate u/s 206AA. Current maximum rate of TDS is 20%.  
															It also applies to TCS u/s 206CC. In the 'Predict Defaults', subsequent to PAN validation, 
