                                                        </h1>
                                                        <h3>
                                                            Version: TDSMAN 27.16
                                                        </h3>
                                                        <h3>
                                                            Version Date: 19th May 2026
                                                        </h3>
                                                        <h3>
                                                            Released Date: 19th May 2026
                                                        </h3>
                                                        </br>
                                                        <h4><b><h3 style='font-weight:bold'>IT Act 2025 - Addition of Tax Year 2026-27</h4> </b>
														<p>The Income Tax Act 2025 has come into force from 1st April ’26 and year has been added into the system. For TDS / TCS for the quarter ended June’26, the new Act will apply.  Some of the relevant important changes on and from TY: 2026-27 are summarized as under:</p>
														<ol><li>Financial Year will be known as Tax Year from 2026-27</li></br>
														<li>Name of the Return Forms has been changed:</li>
														<ul>
														  <li>Form 24Q will be known as Form 138 (Payment to Employees)</li>
														  <li>Form 26Q will be known as Form 140 (Payment to Non-Employees within India)</li>
														  <li>Form 27Q will be known as Form 144 (Foreign Payment)</li>
														  <li>Form 27Q will be known as Form 144 (Foreign Payment)</li>
														  <li>Form 27EQ will be known as Form 143 (Tax Collected at Source)</li></br>
														</ul>
														<li>Section Code will be known as Tax Code from Tax Year 2026-27</li></br>
														<li>Surcharge & Education Cess has been discontinued in Challan as well as Deductee Details</li></br>
														<li>Deductee Code (01-Company, 02-Non-Company) is no more relevant for Form 26Q & Form 27Q</li></br>
														</ol>
														<p>Note:
															The IT Department, is still developing / updating the software for the new year. In this update, we have released three forms (138, 139 & 143). The fourth form 144 (27Q) will be released soon. Further, please note that FVU has not yet been released.</p>
                                                        <h2><b><h2 style='font-weight:bold'>TDSMAN 2026-27 launched</h2> </b>
														<p>No need to install <strong>FY: 2026-27</strong> separately, now you can upgrade to <strong>FY: 2025-26</strong> by just clicking a menu at 
														FY: 2025-26 software and entering the serial no. of <strong>FY: 2026-27</strong>.</p></br>
							                                 <br>Reported bugs rectified.<br/>
							                                         </br>
                                                                 </br><a href = 'https://blog.tdsman.com/' > Click here </a> to view TDSMAN blog.
                                                                      </td>
                                                                      </tr>
                                                                  </table>
                                                              </body>
