                                                                      <h2> Income - tax Act, 2025 - correction return changes incorporated </h2>                   
                                                                           <p>
                                                                               Following the transition to the new Income- tax Act, 2025, the department has made
                                                            substantial changes to the Conso file format and the text-file generation logic applicable
                                                            to correction returns.
                                                        </p>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Several matters relating to correction returns are still awaiting clarification from the
                                                            department.Based on the information and specifications presently available, changes for
                                                           correction returns have been incorporated in this release for the following forms:
                                                       </p>
                                                       <ul>
                                                           <li><strong> Form No. 138(24Q) </strong></li>
                                                           <li><strong> Form No. 140(26Q) </strong></li>
                                                           <li><strong> Form No. 143(27EQ) </strong></li>
                                                           <li><strong> Form No. 144(27Q) </strong></li>
                                                       </ul>
                                                       <p>
                                                           Further changes, wherever required, will be provided through subsequent updates after
                                                           clarifications or revised specifications are issued by the department.
                                                       </p>
                                                       <h2> TDSMAN 2026 - 27 launched </h2>
